# Keep the auto-generated "Source code" archives (git archive / GitHub
# release source tarballs) empty on purpose. The real data ships as the
# latest Release artifact — see README for the download link.
#
# Git attributes don't support negation, so every top-level entry that
# should stay OUT of the source package must be listed explicitly. If you
# add a new top-level file or directory, add it here with `export-ignore`
# (directories need a trailing slash) so it doesn't leak into the source
# package. README.md and LICENSE below are intentionally left un-ignored.
CREDITS.md export-ignore
data/ export-ignore
.github/ export-ignore
.gitignore export-ignore
icons/ export-ignore
source/ export-ignore
tools/ export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
